From: librenms-theme-selector <https://github.com/XBLOssia/librenms-theme-selector>
Subject: [PATCH] (legacy) declare graph_colours.port_in / .port_out in config_definitions.json

Only for undoing what the earlier TWO-file core patch did: patch-core.sh applies this
in reverse when it finds the declaration. The plugin no longer needs it (it stores
the keys with LibrenmsConfig::persist()), and leaving it in place makes a daily.sh
git pull stop whenever upstream edits this file.
---
--- a/resources/definitions/config_definitions.json
+++ b/resources/definitions/config_definitions.json
@@ -2814,8 +2814,24 @@
                 "401F10"
             ],
             "type": "array"
         },
+        "graph_colours.port_in": {
+            "default": [
+                "D7FFC7",
+                "90B040",
+                "608720"
+            ],
+            "type": "array"
+        },
+        "graph_colours.port_out": {
+            "default": [
+                "E0E0FF",
+                "8080C0",
+                "606090"
+            ],
+            "type": "array"
+        },
         "graph_colours.psychedelic": {
             "default": [
